<title>UK: Pru to move management of Scotam funds.</title>
<headline>Pru to move management of Scotam funds.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, July 7 (Reuter) British insurance giant Prudential Corp Plc said on Monday it had decided to transfer management of Scottish Amicable's policyholders' funds from Glasgow to its London investment operation PPM, following the acquisition of the mutual insurer in March.</p>
<p>The Pru also said it would accept Britannia Investment Managers' offer for its 800 million pound ($1.4 billion) third party institutional funds.</p>
</text>
